    dek: "Nestled in the heart of South Carolina, Aiken is a captivating destination where history, culture, and Southern hospitality come together in perfect…",
    heroImage: "/destinations/fall-winter-2025-web/aiken/01-10-hitchcock-woods-largest-urban-forest-in-us-crop-out-left-.jpg",
